From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:33:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: give glass a Vesa material

Vesa glass blurs like Luca, and on app glass lights the window's
rounded edges with a narrow rim in the colour of the glass behind it:
brightest on the corner facing a light above and to the left, fading
along the two edges that meet there, back at a lower strength on the
opposite corner, and never gone anywhere along the outline. It never
bends what is behind a window, since a bend along a long window edge
looks like a fault in the glass. Apps hear it as its own material,
draw their own tint over it like over Luca and can ask for it. A third
frosted wallpaper, barely softened, is there for Vesa shell glass that
blurs only the wallpaper.

Upstream-Status: luft-only Kestrel's Vesa material
---
